    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;PT Sans&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The cumulative rating noise\r\nlevel from all plant and machinery shall not exceed &lt;strong&gt;10dB(A) below the prevailing\r\nbackground noise level &lt;/strong&gt;(measured in accordance with\r\nBS4142:2014) at the nearest noise-sensitive premises. The plant shall operate\r\n24/7 in compliance with &lt;strong&gt;Harrow\r\nCouncil’s plant noise limits&lt;/strong&gt;, and the developer shall ensure\r\nthat these noise limits are achieved and maintained thereafter through\r\nappropriate monitoring and mitigation measures.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
